slides.raw_text:
Self-Referential class
❑A class Person can have a data field next that references 
another object of the same Person class.
❑A series of Person objects would make up a linked list.
▪First Person object points to second Person object.
▪Second Person object points to third Person object, etc.
public class Person {
  String name; 
// Person name
  String address; 
// Person address
  . . . 
// additional data
  Person next; 
// link to another Person object
}

