The Generic LinkedStack<T> class
❑The generic LinkedStack<T> class uses a Node<T> class 
to implement a linked list version of the stack.
package mystack;
// A Generic Linked Stack implementation of elements of type T
public class LinkedStack<T> implements Stack<T> {
 private Node<T> top; 
// Reference to top node in the stack
 private int count; 
// Count of nodes (elements)
  // Constructor for an empty stack
  public LinkedStack() {
    top = null;
    count = 0;
}

